<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Kihilna</book>
  <para style="h">Kihilna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kihilna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kihilna</para>
  <para style="mt">Kihilna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khrist kihilna, Pasian in sil hing tung pai ngeingei dingte asuohte kunga atheisah dinga ama apieh khu, tualeh Aman asuohpa Johan kungah a vansawltah sawl in kihilnate atheisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Johan in Pasian thu leh Jesu Khrist theipina thu leh a sil mute zousie theipi in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam genlawhna thute sim a zate leh asunga thu kigielte zui pouma ahampha hi, aziehpen ahun anaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan in Asia gam a hattuom sagi umte kungah, Ama aum leh, a umsa leh a hing um dingpa akipat leh, A mangtoupha masanga um Hagau sagite akipat, Hepina leh lungmuonna na kung uah um ta hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Khrist theipipa ginum, mishi lah a piengmasapen leh leitung leengte tunga vaihawmpa akipat leh, Ama eite hing it a, i khelna ua kipata A sisan a hing silsiengpa leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian leh a Pa kunga leeng leh siempu a hing siempa kungah thupina leh vaihawmnate kumtawn kumtawnin umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En un, meipi toh ahing pei hi, mi chintengin Ama amu ding ua, Ama sunte ngelin zong amu ding uhi Leitung namte zousie Ama ziehin akap ding uhi. Tuabang hita hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei Alpha leh Omega, a Masapen leh a Tawpna ka hi,” Mangpa A umlel, a umsa leh ahing pei dingpa, Bangkimbawlthei in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei Johan na unaupa u’leh Jesu Khrist a gimthuohna leh kukalna a na thuohpi u leh leenggam zieh a na thuohpi uh, Pasian thu leh Jesu Khrist ka theipina ziehin Patmos kichi tuilaisie gam ah ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa ni in Hagau in ka um a, ka nua langah pengkul ging banga aw ngaitah ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kei Alpha leh Omega, Amasapen leh Anukhia pen ka hi, na sil mute laibu ah giel inlen, Asia gam a um hattuom sagite: Ephesa hattuom, Smarna hattuom, Pergamos hattuom, Thiatira hattuom, Sardis hattuom, Philadelphia hattuom leh Laodisia hattuomte kungah hah in ahing chi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei hing houpi aw khu en dingin ka kihei a, tuachia ka kihei leh sana a kibawl meivah tunna sagi ka mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh tua meivah tunna laikimtah ah mihing Tapa bang mikhat, akephang donga puontuol sil, a awm sana puonhuol a kigah ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alutang leh asam khu samul bangin akaanga, vua bangin a vam hi, tualeh a mitte khu meikuong abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akengte sum eng mei a kihal taah, kinawtval bangin asienga, A aw lah tui tampi luong ging bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman akhut ziet langah aasi sagi a tawi a, akam a kipat namsau alangni a tattuo hiem tah mai a pawt a, tualeh amel khu ni hasat a asat laitah bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ama ka mu tahin akengbulah ashisa bangin ka puata hi. Hinanleh Aman akhut zietlam ka tungah angam a, ka kungah, “Zau sin, Kei Amasa pen leh a Nukhia pen ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei Ahingpa ka hi, tualeh ka shi a, Ngai vawi, kumtawnin ka hing ahi, Amen. Tualeh ken mishi khuo leh Shina kot chabi ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sil musate leh sil umlaite leh sil hing um dingte, giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka khut zietlam a aasi sagi na mute leh, Sana meivah tunna sagite thuguh pen: aasi sagite khu hattuom sagite Vansawlsiengte ahi ua, meivahtunna sagi na mute pen hattuom sagite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ephesa hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tami giel in; A khut zietlam a aasi sagi tawipa, sana meivah tunna sagite laikim tah a vahkawi kawipa’n tam thute agen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima’n na nasepte, na sepgimnate, kukaltaha na thuoh hatnate, migiloute na thuohtheilou dan ka thei hi. Tualeh sawltahte ka hi uh kichi lah hivawtloute na etkhiet a mi zuou ahidan uh na mudoh dan zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thuohzou a, na kukal a, tualeh Ka min zieh a na sepgimdan leh na basap loudan ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivang in Na itna masapen na nuasie taah ziehin, tam thu ah demna ka hing nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin na puana laitah theingitnget inlen, kisia inlen, tualeh na silbawl masate bawlkia in, na kisia sihleh kintahin na kungah kang pei dinga, na meivahtunna khu amun a kipat in ka suon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tami na nei uh ahoi hi, Nikolaitante nasep na hua a Ken zong tuakhu ka huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen bilnei tapouin za heh. Aguolzoupa kungah, Pasian Pradise laikim a um hinna sikunga apat neh ding ka pe ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smarna hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambangin giel in: Amasapen leh anukhiapen, shi a, hingkiapa’n tam thute agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na nasepte, na gimgenthei thuohna leh na zawn dan, ka thei hi, hinanleh na hausa hi, tualeh Juda ka hi uh chia, lah hivawtloute Pasian gensietna ka thei hi, amaute Setan kikhopna inn ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hing thuoh ding silte bangma Gingsin, Ngai un ze-et a na um theina dingun dawimangpa’n na lah ua pawlkhat suongkul ah ahing khum dinga, ni sawm sung gimthuohna na nei ding uhi, shi tandongin ginum un, tuachi’n hinna manglukhu ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bilnei taphot in za heh. Aguolzoupa khu shi nina suhnatin a um sih ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pergamos hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambangin gielin: Ama namsau alangni a tattuo hiemtah neipa’n tam thute agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na nasepte leh na tenna mun tua Setan toupha umna ka thei hi. Tualeh ka Min na pomdet a, Setan tenna na lah ua ka martar muonhuoi Antipas tha a a umlai in zong Kei nang gintatna na tawpsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh demna themkhat ka hing nei hi, aziehpen Balaam thuhilna zuite tuanah na umpi a, ama’n Israel tate masangah kipat puana bawl ding leh, milim biehna kilan silte ne ding leh numei pasal kaal a thangtatnate bawl dingin Balak athu hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuamabangin Nikolaitan pawlte thuhilna zuimi pawlkhat zong na nei a, tua khu ka huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisia in, tua ahisihleh na kungah kintahin kang pei dinga, ka kama pawt namsau in amaute ka dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bil neitaphot in za heh. Aguolzoupa kungah manna phuolguh a neh ding ka pe ding hi. Tualeh suong kaang khat, atunga min tha kigiel, atangpa loungal midang Koima’n atheilou ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thiatira hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambangin giel in: Pasian Tapa meikuong bang mit neipa leh sum-eng nawt eng bang keng neipa’n tam thute a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na nasepte, na itna, na naseppiehte, na ginnate leh na thuohhatnate ka thei hi; tualeh na silbawl masapen sangin anukhia pen atamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahivang in demna themkhat ka hing nei hi, aziehpen tuo numei Jezebel na awiam hi, amanu’n ama leh ama guolneinu ka hi. Kichiin, ka suohte numei pasal kaala thangtatna leh milim biehna silte ne dingin athuhil a, asolzou gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amanu a angkawmna apat kisia dingin hun ka pie a, hinanleh akisia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai in, amanu china lupna tung sena’n ka nei dinga, tualeh a angkawmpite zong, asilbawlte uh akisia sih u’leh, gimgenthei thuohna thupitah ah ka pailut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh atate shina in ka thatgam dinga, tualeh hattuom zousie in kei khu, lungsim leh lungtang enchienpa ka hi chi athei ding uhi. Tualeh noute na nasep dungzui un ka hing pe chiet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Nang leh Thiatira khuo a um, tam kithuhilna zuiloute leh Setan thugil thuhtah, kichite thei nailou midang zousie kungah ka gen ahi, puohgih dang na tung uah ka hing guon sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing pei masangsie’n na neisa u’khu tukip chinten un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh aguolzoupa leh atawpdonga ka nasepte kemchingpa kungah, namte tunga thuneina ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman sia chieng toh amaute vai ahawm dinga, belkhengpa belte aneng nenga akehzah dimdem bang ahi ding hi, tua thuneina pen ken zong Ka Pa akipat ka mu bangin ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh ama kungah zingsol aasi zong ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bil nei taphot in za heh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sardis hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambang in giel in: “Pasian Hagau sagi leh aasi sagi neipa’n tam thute agen hi. Na nasepte ka thei hi, Ahing min na puo a, hinanleh ashi na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khanglou inlen, shi dihdih a um nalaite suhat in, aziehpen Pasian mai ah na nasep abukim in ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin na mudan leh na zahdan theizing inlen, tukip inlen, kisia in. Tuaziehin na kiven sih leh, guta bangin na kungah ka hing pei ding a, bangchih hun a hing tung ding ka hiei na theisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Sardis ah apuonte uh subualou min tawmnoukhat na nei hi, tualeh amaute kei toh puon vam sil in aleeng ding uhi, aziehpen tuabang a umtah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aguolzoupa’n puon vamte asil dinga, tualeh amin khu hinna laibu apat nawtmang ahi sih ding hi, hinanleh ka Pa mai leh vansawlsiengte mai ah, amin ka puongkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bil nei taphot in za heh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Philadelphia hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambangin giel in: Ama Asiengthoupa leh Adihpa, Ama David sawhehna neipa, ahon chienga koiman akha theilou, akha chieng a koiman ahon theiloupa’n tam thute agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na nasepte ka thei hi, na masangah koima kha theilou kot kihongsa’n ka koi hi, aziehpen thahatna neunoukhat na nei a, ka thu na kemden a, tualeh ka min na kitheimawbawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, Setan kikhopna inn a mi, Judami ka hi, chia lah hivawtlou, zuou gente, ngai in, na mai ah kang peisah dinga na kengbul ah ka hing besah ding a, nang ka hing it chi ka theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kukal dinga ka hing thupieh na zui zing zieh in, leitung pumpi a mi umte ze etna hing tung pai ding, ahing tun hun chieng in, ken zong ka hing kembit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, hing pei pai ding ka hi, na manglukhu koima’n ahing lahpieh louna dingin na neisa kembit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aguolzoupa khu, Ka Pasian bieh inn ah suutpi in ka pangsah ding a, apawtdoh nawn sih ding hi, tualeh atungah ka Pasian min leh ka Pasian khopi Jerusalem tha min ka giel ding a, tua khopi pen vana Ka Pasian a kipata hing kumsuh ahia, atungah ka mintha ka giel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bil neitaphot in za heh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodisia hattuom vansawlsieng kungah tambangin giel in: Amen, Aginumpa leh Adihtah theipipa, Pasian silsiem kipatnapain tam thute agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na nasepte ka thei hi; lum lah lumlou, vawt lah votlou a na um pen, na lum leh lum vanglah in, na vawt leh vawt vanglah lachin ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachia lumsim pelpul a, lumlah lumlou, vawt lah votlou a, na umziehin ka kam a kipat in ka hing sekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen, Nangman ka hauta, ka neizouta a, bangma ka tasam sih na chi hi, hinanleh mi genthei, hepihuoi, tasam, mitto leh guohtang, na hi lam na kithei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na hing hausat theina dingin, sana mei a kihal siengset leh na guohtang zumhuoina dohlouna dinga na sil ding puon vam leh na muthei na dinga na mit a na nu ding, mitnalou ka kunga pat lei dingin ka hing deisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte ka phawhhil a, ka thunun hi, tuaziehin phatuomngai inlen, kisia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in, kotkha bul a dingin kot ka kiu hi, mi Koipou in ka aw azah a, kot ahon leh a kungah ka lut ding a, ama toh nitah ann kane khawm ding a, tualeh aman zong kei toh ane ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aguolzoupa khu ka kungah, Ka mangtoupha ah ka tousah dinga, Kei zong ka guolzaw a Ka Pa toh aleengtoupha a ka tou mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hattuomte kunga Hagau thugen zahna ding bil nei taphot in za heh, chi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain ka en a, En vawi, van ah kot akihonga, tualeh ka aw zahmasah pen pengkul ging bangin kei ahing houpi a, “Tam langah hing peitou in, tunua chieng a sil hing um dingte, ka hing musah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhat in Hagau in ka dimta a; tualeh Ngai vawi, van ah mangtoupha khat akidaw a, tua mangtoupha tungah Mi khat atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tuana toupa pen Jasper leh Sardius suongmantam bangin akilanga, tua mangtoupha kimvel ah, Emerald suongmantam banga kilang sakhituihup azam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mangtoupha kimkot ah, mangtoupha sawmni leh li a um a, tualeh tua touphate tungah upa sawmni leh li puom vam sil a tou ka mu a, amauten sana lukhu alutung uah akhuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua mangtoupha apat in, tunphete, vanpi gingte, awte ahing pawt hi. Tua leh tua mangtoupha mai ah, meivah sagi akuong a, tuate khu Pasian Hagau Sagite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua mangtoupha masangah Kristal banga sieng tui himlang kuongpi a um hi. Tualeh tua mangtoupha laikim leh mangtoupha kimkot ah mailam leh nualam mit a dim silhing li a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Silhing khatna pen humpibahnei toh akibanga, silhing nina pen bawngnou toh akibang hi, tualeh silhing thumnain mihing maitang bang maitang anei a, silhing lina pen mupi leenglai a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua silhing liten ha guh chiet anei ua, tua hate asunglam leh akimvel ah mit in adim a Amauten sun le zan tawlngalouin: “Siengthou, Siengthou, Siengthou Mangpa Pasian bangkimbawlthei, Umsa leh umlel leh hing Umdingpa ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua silhing liten mangtoupha tunga toupa, kumtawn kumtawn a hingzingpa kungah, thupina leh pahtawina pie a kipahthu agen tahchieng un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Upa sawmni leh lite khu tua mangtoupha tunga toupa mai ah abohkhup ua, kumtawn kumtawn a hingzingpa khu abie ua, tualeh tua mangtoupha mai ah alukhute koi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Nangpen, “Thupina leh pahtawina leh, thuneina tang taah na hi. Aziehpen Nang bangkim na siema, Nangma deina banga siem leh, um ahi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ama mangtoupha tunga toupa zietlam ah, asunglam leh apulam a kigiel chiemtena sagi a kichiemte laibuziel khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng hattah khat, aw ngaitah a kikouin, “Koi ahiei laibuziel khu honga, tua chiemtenate pheltaah, chi ka mu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh van ah hiin, leitungah hileh ahisihleh leinuoi ah hitaleh, tua laibuziel hong thei leh en thei mi koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua laibuziel hong ding leh sim ding ahiei ahisihleh en taah koima akimulou ziehin ha ka in ka kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n upate lah a khat in ka kungah, “Kap sin; En vawi, Juda nam humpibahnei, David zungpi in tua laibuziel hong ding leh tua chiemtena sagite phel dingin aguolzouta hi,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ka en a, Ngai vawi, mangtoupha leh silhing lite lai ah leh upate lai ah, thasa hileh kilawm, Belamnou, kii sagi leh mit sagi nei, ding ka muta a, tua silte khu Pasian Hagau sagi, leitung pumpi a sawldohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama ahing pei a; mangtoupha tunga toupa khut zietlam a laibuziel khu alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua laibuziel khu alah tahin silhing lite leh upa sawmni leh lite khu Belamnou masangah abohkhup ua, amauten kaiging khat chiet leh gimnamtui a dim sana hengkuong khat atawi chiet ua, tua khu misiengthoute thungetnate ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amauten la tha khat asa ua, “Nangpen laibuziel la a, tua chiemtenate phel taah na hi; aziehpen thain na um a, Pasian adingin chi chin, ham chin, mi chin, namchin, lah a kipat koute na sisan in, na hing tanta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh i Pasian ua dingin leengte, leh siempute in na hing siemta hi, tualeh leitungah vai ihawm ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka en a, mangtoupha leh silhingte leh upate kimkot ah vansawlsieng tampite aw ka za a, atamdan uh pen tul sawm mun tul sawm leh atul atul tampi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw ngaitah in, “Tha a um Belamnou khu, Thuneinate hausatnate pilnate, thahatnate, pahtawinate, thupinate leh guolzawlnate, tangtaah ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh vantunga um, leitunga um, lei nuoia um leh tuipi sunga um, silsiem chintengin Mangtoupha tunga toupa leh Belamnou kungah; “Guolzawlnate, pahtawinate, thupinate, thuneinate, kumtawn kumtawn in umzingta hen,” achi uh ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n silhing liten, “Amen” achi uhi. Tualeh upa sawmni leh liten, khupboh in, Ama kumtawn kumtawn a hing zingpa khu abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Belamnou in chiemtena sagite lah a khat aphel ka mu a, tualeh silhing lite lah a khat in vanpi ging banga ngai aw in, “Hing pei inlen hing en in,” ahing chi zong ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ka et leh, Ngai vawi, Sakol kang khat ka mu hi. Tualeh atunga tuongpa’n thalpi khat atawia; tualeh akungah manglukhu khat akipie a, ama khu guolzou leh guolzou zel ding in akuonkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Belamnou in chiemtena nina aphel tahin, silhing nina in “Hing pei inlen, hing en in” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh sakol dang meikuong banga san khat ahing pawtdoh a, atunga tuongpa kungah, leitung apat galmuonna alahmang theina ding leh mite khat leh khat kithatuo sah theina thuneina akipie a, tualeh namsau lienpi khat zong akipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Belamnou in chiemtena thumna aphel laitahin, silhing thumna in, “Hing pei inlen, hing en in,” achi ka za hi. Tualeh ka et leh, Ngai vawi, sakol vom khat ka mu a; atunga tuongpa’n akhutin tena atawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh silhing lite lah a kipat in aw khat in “Mangbu chin khat man khu makhai khat ahia, barli chin thum man khu makhai khat man ahi, tualeh sathau leh uoin pen suse sin achi hi ka za hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Belamnou in chiemtena lina aphel laitah in, silhing lina in, “Hing pei inlen, hing en in” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachia ka et leh, Ngai vawi, sakol daang khat ka mu a, atunga tuongpa min khu Shina ahi a, tualeh mishikhuoin ama azui hi. Tualeh amaute kungah, namsau toh, kiel toh, shina toh, leitung gamsahangte, that dingin leitung seli suo sekhat tunga thuneina pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Belamnou in chiemtena ngana ahon laitah in, Pasian thu zieh leh atheipina apom zieh ua tha a na umte hinna hagaute maitam nuoi a um ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute aw ngaitah a kikou in, “Aw Mangpa Thuneina bukim neipa, Siengthou leh dih, bangtan ahiei leitunga tengte tunga vaihawmlou leh ka sisan phuba uh la lou a um ding na hiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hagaute kungah puonvam khat chiet akipie a, tualeh amaute banga tha a hing um ding, asuoh hipite u’leh a unaute uh akim masangsie, na ngah nalai tadi dinga hilin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Belamnou in chiemtena guhna aphel laitah in ka et leh, Ngai vawi, ziil nasatah in akilinga, tualeh ni khu samul sai ip puon bangin ahing vomta a, hapi khu sisan bangin ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van a aasite khu theipi kung huipi hattahin a sem a, aga nuhkhiatte apul bangin leitung ah akie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Van khu laibuziel, kizielbei bangin amangta a muol leh taang leh tulaisie gam chinteng a umna mun ua kipat suon mangin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh leitung leengte leh, mithupite, mi hausate, galkap lamkai liente, mi hatte, tualeh saltang leh zalen mi zousie kohawm sung leh muol tunga suongpi kawmte ah akibuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Muol leh taangte leh suongpite kungah, “Hing netkhum unlen, Ama mangtoupha tunga toupa mai a kipat leh Belamnou lungthahna apat in hing sel un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama lungthahna ni thupi hing tung ahita, koi ahiei dingzou ding?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nua in, lei ning li a ding vansawlsieng li ka mu hi. Amaun leitung leh tuipi tung ahisihleh singkung mawngmawng tunga laang lou dingin leitung hui lite atutang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng dang khat, suolam akipata hing peitou, Pasian hing chiemtena nei khat ka mu hi. Ama’n, leitung leh tuipi suhsietna ding thuneina kipie vansawlsieng lite kungah aw ngaitah in akikou a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“I Pasian suohte talpanga chiemte na ikoi sieng zou masangsie, leitung leh tuipi ahisihleh singkungte suse sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh chiemte a umte phaza ka za a; Israel tate nam zousie apat tul za khat tul sawmli leh tul li, chiemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda nam apat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Reuben nam apat tul sawm leh tulni, chiemte ahi; Gad nam apat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asher nam apat tul sawm leh tulni, chiemte ahi; Naphtali nam apat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Manasseh nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeon nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Levi nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Issakar nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulun nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Joseph nam akipat tul sawm leh tul ni, chiemte ahi; Benjamin nam akipat tul sawm leh tulni, chiemte ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam silte nua a ka et leh, Ngai vawi, mipi tampitah koima simsenglou, nam zousie, chi chin, michin leh ham chin apat puon vam sil a, akhut ua tum sing bate, tawi a mangtoupha leh Belamnou mai a ding ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute aw ngaitahin akikou ua; “Hundam na khu Mangtoupha tunga tou, I Pasian u’leh Belamnou a ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsiengte zousie khu, mangtoupha leh upate leh silhing lite kimkot ah ading ua tualeh mangtoupha mai a khupboh a pua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen, guolzawlnate, thupinate leh pilnate, kipahthugennate leh pahtawinate, thuneinate leh thahatnate, i Pasian kungah kumtawn kumtawnin um zingta hen. Amen,” chiin Pasian abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n upate laha khat in kei ahing houpi a, ka kungah, “Tam puon ngou silte koite ahi uoi? Tualeh hei a kipata hing pei ahi uoi?” chi’n ahing donga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ken akungah, “Pu aw Nangman na thei hi,” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n Aman ka kungah, “Tamte khu gimthuohna thupitah akipat a hing pawtdohte ahi ua, apuonte uh Belamnou sisan a sawpa ngousahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute Pasian mangtoupha mai a um in, A biehinn ah sun leh zan in Ana asem uhi. Tualeh Ama mangtoupha tunga toupa khu alah uah ateng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Agil uh akiel ngai nawn sih ding a, adangta ngai nawn sih ding uhi, Nisa in amaute aka nawn sih dinga, asatna zong athuoh kha nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen mangtoupha laikimtah a, Belamnou khu amaute chingpa ahita dinga, hinna tuinahte ah apui ding hi. Tualeh Pasian in amit ua kipat ahituite, uh anot hul pieh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belamnou in chiemtena sagina aphel laitah in, naikal kimkhat sung van asip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mai a ding tua vansawlsieng sagite ka mu a, tualeh akung uah pengkul sagi akipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng dang khat ahing pei a, gimnamtui halna sana belkuong tawi in, maitam mai ah ading hi. Tualeh ama kungah, Mangtoupha mai a sana maitam tunga, misiengthoute thungetna toh alat khawm dingin gimnamtui tampi akipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua vansawlsieng khut a kipat in gimnamtui khu leh misiengthoute thungetna Pasian mai ah azamtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng in gimnamtui hal na belkuong ala a, maitam akipat mei aluoh dim a, leitungah athe suhta hi. Tuabep in, husate, vanpigingte, Temple leh zil lingte ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua vansawlsieng sagi pengkul sagi tawite khu amutging dingin akisa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vansawlsieng khat na in amutta a; Giel leh mei sisan toh kihal in azuita a, tuate khu leitungah akipaikhe suh a, sing kungte sethum suo sekhat akatumta a, hampa hing zousie akatumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Vansawlsieng nina in amutta a; Muol lienpi mei a kaa hileh kilawm, bang ahiei khat tuipi sunga pailut in auma; tualeh tuipi sethum suo sekhat sisan asuohta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh tuipi a um ganhingte sethum suo sekhat ashita a, tualeh tembawhte sethum suo sekhat suhsiet ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng thumna in amutta a, van akipat aasi lienpi khat meisel banga kuong ahing kesuh a, luidungte sethum suo sekhat leh tuinahte tungah atu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua aasi min khu Gamsai ahi, tualeh tuite sethum suo sekhat akhasahta a, tua tui akipat mi tampi asihta uhi, khatsah ahi tahziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng lina in amutta a, ni sethum suo sekhat, hapi sethum suo sekhat aasite sethum suo sekhat, suhsietin a umta, tuachi’n tuate sethum suo sekhat suhsiet a mielsah ahita a, sun sethum suo sekhat ataangta sih a, tuamabangin zan zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachia ka et leh vanlai zawl a leeng vansawlsieng khat in aw ngaitah in, “Tunggih! tunggih! tunggih! vansawlsieng um nalai thumte pengkul mut ding ziehin, leitung a tengte tung agih hi!” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng ngana in amut a, aasi khat van akipat leitunga kesuh ka mu a, tualeh akungah kokhuh tobei chabi pieh in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman kokhuh tobei ahonga, tuachi’n tua kokhuh a kipat in haltuina mei phuolpi khu bangin meikhu akitungtou hi; tua kokhuh meikhu in ni leh van amiel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua meikhu laha kipat in khauphe leitungah ahing pawtdoh a Ama-ute kungah leitung a mom aite silbawltheina bangbang, silbawltheina pieh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute khu atalpang ua Pasian chiemtena neilou mite chilou, leitunga hampa ahiei, loupa hing ahiei, ahisihleh singkung mawngmawng suse lou dinga thupieh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute tha theina thuneina pieh ahi sih ua, hinanleh ha nga sung sugenthei dinga hil ahi ua, a suhgentheina pen mom ai in mi akei chieng a anat bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin miten shina a sui ding ua, amu sih ding uhi; shi a ut ding ua, hinanleh shina in amauh ataimangsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua khauphete mel puohdan khu galdou dinga kiguongsa sakolte bang ahi ua, alutung uah sana a kibawl hileh kilawm manglukhu akhu ua, a mai uh mihingte mai abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaun numei sam bang sam anei ua, aha ukhu humpibahnei ha abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amaun sia awmphaw bang awmphaw anei ua, tualeh ahazap ging uh, kidou dinga tai sakolleng tampi ging bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun mom ai meibang mei anei ua, ameite uah gu a um hi, athuneina u’khu ha nga sung mihingte suhgentheina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun tua kokhuh tobei vansawlsieng khu leengpa in anei uhi, Amin khu Hebru ham in Abaddon ahia, Greek ham in Apollion akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tunggihna khat a beita. Ngai un, tam silte nua chiengin tunggihna ni ahing tung ding a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng guhnain amut a: Pasian mai a um sana maitam kii lite akipat in aw khat ka za a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua aw in, Pengkul tawi vansawlsieng guhna kung ah, “Euphrates luipi lien a vansawlsiengli hensa a kikoite hadohin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua vansawlsieng lite pen, anaikal, ani, aha leh akum huntah a mihingte zousie sethum suo sekhat that dinga mansa a kikoite hakhiet ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua sakol tungtuong galkap honte tamdan tul mun tul za ni, ahi uh chi amauh phaza ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mengmuna ka mu sakolte tambang ahi uhi: Tua sakol tungtuong te’n, meikuong banga san leh dumsan tualeh kaat banga eng awmphawte anei uhi, tua sakolte lutangte khu humpibahnei lutangte bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Akamsung ua kipata hing pawt tam gawtna hipi thumte, mei leh meikhu leh kaat in mihing zousie sethum suo sekhat athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen tua sakolte silbawltheina khu akam sung u’leh amei ua um ahia, amei ukhu gul bang ahi, tualeh lutangte anei ua, tuate in mite asugenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam natna gawtna hite a shilou mihing um nalai teng lah, dawite leh mu lah mutheilou, zah lah zatheilou, pei lah peitheilou, sana milimte leh sing milimte abieh louna ding ua, akhut ua asilbawlte uh tawpsan dingin akisia tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh atuolthana u’leh, dawithu a amibumna u’leh, numei pasal kaal a athangtatna u’leh aguhtatna ua kipat in zong akisia tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh ahat mama vansawlsieng dang khat meilum puon a silin van a kipat a hing peisuh ka mu hi. Alutungah sakhituihup khat a um a, amaitang ni bang ahi a, tualeh akengte meikuong khuom bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman akhut in akiphensa laibu neu khat atawi hi. Tualeh akeng zietlam in tuipi tung atuon a, akeng veilam in leitung atuon hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ama khu humpibahnei hawh bangin aw ngaitahin akikou hi. Tualeh akikou laitahin vanpiging sagiten aw asuota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh vanpiging sagiten a aw uh asuotah un, giel dingin ka kisata a, hinanleh van akipat aw khat in ka kungah, “Vanpiging sagite thugente imchinten inlen giel sin,” hing chi’n ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuipi tung leh leitung tuon a ding vansawlsieng ka mu pen in, akhut zietlam vanlam ah atungtou a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh kumtawn kumtawn a hing zingpa, van leh asunga sil umte, leitung leh asunga sil umte, tuipi leh asunga sil umte, siempa min in akichiem a: Ahun sawtnawn lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh vansawlsieng sagina aw gin lai nite a, pengkul amut dingkuon chiengin, Pasian thuguh kiphuol khu asuoh guolneite kunga ana gensa bangin atungkimta ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n van a kipat a aw ka zah pen in, Kei ang houpi kia a, “Pei inlen tuipi leh leitung tuon a ding vansawlsieng khuta laibu neu phensa a um, va la in,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng kungah ka vapei a, akungah laibu neu khu Kei hing piein ka vachi a, tualeh Aman ka kungah, “La inlen, nein, Laibu in na gilpi akhasah dinga, hinanleh na kam ah pen khuoizu bangin ahum ding,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua vansawlsieng khut a pat in laibu neu ka la a, ka neta hi, tualeh tami ka kam ah khuoizu bangin ahum hi. Hinanleh ka neh zouin ka gilpi akhata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Mi tampite, namte, hamte leh leengte mai ah Pasian thu genlawhna na gen kia ngeingei ding ahi,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n tena chieng bang pumpeng khat ahing kipie a, tualeh vansawlsieng khu a dinga, ka kungah “Thou inlen, Pasian Biehinn leh maitam leh asunga, abemite te in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh biehinn huong pulam pen nuasie inlen, te sin, tampen Jentelte kunga pieh ahita hi. Tualeh khopi siengthou khu amaun ha sawm li leh ha ni sung atuonden ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ka theipimi nite kungah silbawltheina ka pe dinga amaun sai ip puon silin ni tul khat zani leh sawmguh sung thu agen ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte khu leitung Pasian mai a ding Olive singkung nite leh meivah tunna nite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi koipou in amauh suhnat asawm chiengun a kam ua kipat mei hing pawt in agalte uh akatum a; tualeh mi koipou in amauh asuhnat sawm u’leh tambanga tha ngei ngei ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam miten athugen hun sung ua guo azuh louna dingin van khahbing theina thuneina anei ua, tualeh tui sisan suohsah theina leh a ut hun hun ua, hii namkim a leitung gawt theina thuneina zong anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun atheipina thu uh agen zou chiengun, kokhuh tobei a pat a hing pawttou gamsain amauh akidoupi dinga, azou dinga, tualeh athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh aluong u’khu hagau lam a Sodom leh Izipt kichi i Mangpa u’zong kilbeh a aumna khopi thupitah gawlzing ah alum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite leh phung chin, hamchin leh namchin a kipat miten, ni thum leh akim aluong uh a en ding ua, aluong u’khu vui ding aphal sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh leitunga tengte amauh tungah akipah ding ua, lungnopna abawl ding ua, silpiehte akihah tua ding uhi, aziehpen tam guolnei nite’n leitunga tengte ana bawlgenthei mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh ni thum leh akimkhat nuain, Pasian akipat hinna hagau asung uah alut a, akeeng un adingta ua; amute zousie tungah zauna nasatah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh van a kipat a, aw ngaitah in amaute gel kungah, “Tam langah hing peitou un,” achi khu azata uhi. Tualeh amaute gel khu meilum lah ah van ah akaltouta uhi, amelmate un zong amauh amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin zil nasatah in alinga, khopi sesawm suo sekhat achimta hi, tua zilling ah mi tul sagi ashi ua, adangte azau mama ua, van Pasian kung ah thupina apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tunggihna nina abeita a, ngai un, tunggihna thumna hing tung pai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng sagina in apengkul amutta a, van ah aw ngaitahte aging a, “Leitung leenggamte khu i Mangpa leh Ama Khrist leenggam ahing hita a, Aman kumtawn kumtawnin vai ahawm ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mai a amangtoupha ua tou upa sawmni leh lite khu khupboh in apua ua, Pasian abie ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian, Bangkimbawlthei, A um zing, aum lai leh ahing um dingpa, Na kungah “Kipahthu ka hing pie uhi. Aziehpen Nangman Na silbawltheina, thupitah na lata a vai nahawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namte alungthah ua, na thangpaina ahing tungta hi, mishite thu na khenpiehna ding leh, Na suoh guolneite leh misiengthoute leh, Na min giingte, milien leh mi neute kunga, kipahman na piehna hun leh, Leitung suse mite na suhsietna ding hun, ahing tungta hi;” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n van ah Pasian biehinn akihongta a, tualeh Abiehinn sunga Athuhun bawm ahing kimu hi. Tualeh tunphiete, husate, van gingte, zilling leh giel nasatah ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n van ah chiemtena lamdang tah ahing kilang a; numei khat Ni a kijem, akeng nuoi a hapi um, tualeh alutunga aasi sawm leh ni a kijem manglukhu khuin ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amanu agailai ahi a, nau suoh dinga nauvei natna thuohin akikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh van ah chiemtena dang khat ahing kilanga, Ngai vawi, dragon san lienpi, lutang sagi leh kii sawmnei, tualeh manglukhu sagi khu ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amei in van a aasi sethumsuo sekhat apaikhie a leitung sena’n anei hi. Tualeh anau ahing suoh hun hun a na valzou pai dingin dragon khu numei nausuoh ding nu mai ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n ta pasal khat nam zousie tunga sia chieng a vaihawm ding khat ahing neikheta hi, tua naungeh pen Pasian leh amangtoupha ah lahtouin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei pen Pasian in mun abawlpiehna ah ni tul khat zani leh sawmguh sung kep ding in ataimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n van ah kidouna a um a: Mikael leh a vansawlsiengten dragon adou ua, tualeh dragon leh avansawltahten zong adou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh dragon leh avansawltahten a zou sih ua, amun u’zong van ah muin a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n dragon lien khu paidohin aumta a, tua tanglai gulpi, dawimangpa leh Setan kichi leitung pumpi solpa khu leitunga paikhiet in a umta a, avansawltahte zong ama toh paikhiet in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n van ah aw ngaitah khat ka za a tua aw in: “Tuin i Pasian uh hundamna leh, thahatna leh leenggam leh, A Khrist thuneina ahing tungta hi; aziehpen isanggamte uh hehpa, paikhiet in a umta hi; Aman asun azanin amaute, i Pasian mai ah aheh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amauten Belamnou sisan leh atheipina, thute zieh in ama azouta ua, tualeh shitandongin ahinna uh, a it sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw nou vante leh, asunga tengte kipah un, Leitung leh tuipi a tengte tung agih hi, aziehpen hun tomnou khat, aneita chi athei ziehin, Dawimangpa lungthah sengsengin na kung uah, ahing pei suhta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n dragon in leitunga paikhiet ahi chi akithei tahin, tua numei tapa neinu agawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tua numeinu gamdaia aumna ding mun a alenlut theina dingin, muvanlai lientah ha ni pieh ahi a, tua mun ah hun khat leh hunte leh hun kimkhat, tua gulpi muphah louna ah kepin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n gulpi in numeinu tui in atawmang sah theina dingin anua langah tuisanglet bangmai in akam apat tui aphitkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh leitungin numeinu apanpi a, leiin akam akaah a, tua dragon in akam apat aphitkhiet tuipi lien khu avalbeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh dragon khu numeinu tungah alungthah a, ahahasuonte, Pasian thupieh zuite leh Jesu Khrist theipina thu pom mite dou dingin akuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n dragon khu tuipi pieu ah, a ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuipi pieunel tungah ka dinga, tuipi akipat in gamsa khat lutang sagi leh kii sawm nei, tualeh akiite tunga manglukhu sawm nei, tualeh alutangte tungchiet ua Pasian gensiet na min nei hing pawtdoh ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ka gamsa mu khu gielbem abanga, akengte vompi keng abanga, akam humpibahnei kam bang ahi. Tualeh dragon in, asilbawltheina leh amangtoupha leh athuneina, tua gamsa kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Alutangte lah a khat khu shipi tham aliem hileh kilawm in ka mu a, hinanleh shipi tham a aliemna khu ahing damta a, leitung pumpi in tua gamsa khu lamdangsa in azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun tua gamsa kunga thuneina pepa dragon khu abie ua, gamsa zong abie ua, “Tam gamsa bang koi a um ei? Ama dou thei ding koi a um ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh sil thupitahte genna ding leh Pasian gensietna ding kam akunga pieh ahia, tualeh ha sawmli leh hani sunga dingin thuneina pieh in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Pasian gensietna leh, Amin leh abiehbuh leh van a umte gensietna in akam akaahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh akungah misiengthoute dou ding leh zou dingin phalna apeta hi. Tualeh phung chin, ham chin, leh nam chin, tunga thuneina pieh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh leitunga teng zousie, leitung siemchil a kipat a gawsa Belamnou hinna laibu a amin uh kigiellou poumain tua gamsa abe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi koipou in bil aneileh za heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koipou in mi sal a apuilut leh ama zong sal a puilut ahi dinga, Koipou in namsau a mi atha leh ama zong namsau a thain a um ding hi. Tanah misiengthoute kukalna leh ginna akilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamsa dang khat leitunga kipat hing pawtdoh ka mu a, aman belamnou bangin kii ni anei a, tualeh dragon bangin thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman gamsa masapen thuneina zousie amit mu in azang a, aman leitung leh asunga tengte zousie in, tua gamsa masa pen shina khop aliem damkia khu abesahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman chiemtena lamdang thupitahte abawla, mihingte mitmuin van a kipat mei nangawn akesuh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua gamsa masapen mitmu a chiemtena lamdangte bawltheina akunga pieh a umte zang in, leitunga tengte kungah, namsau a satna maliem nei a hing nalai tua gamsa lim na bawl ding uh ahi, chiin leitunga tengte asolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh gamsa masapen lim kibawl a ham sah theina ding leh, gamsa lim be nuomloute atha theina dinga, gamsa lim kunga hinna hu pieh theina thuneina piehin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman mi zousie aneu alien, azawng ahau, saltang leh noplen hitaleh, akhut zietlam uh ahiei, ahisihleh atalpang uah chiemtena abawlpieh chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua chiemtena ahiei, gamsa min ahiei, ahisihleh amin nambat ahiei, neiloute poumain a leithei sih ding ua, azua thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tanah pilna apoimaw dan alang hi. Koipou theisiemna neiten gamsa nambat tuot heh, aziehpen mihing nambat ahi, anambat pen zaguh sawmguh leh guh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka en a, Ngai vawi, Zion muol tunga Belamnou leh mi tulza leh tulsawmli leh tul li ding ka mua, atalpang chiet uah ama min leh Apa min chiet uh akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh van a kipat aw khat ka za a, tui tampi luong ging bang leh, vanpi ging ngaitah bang ahi a, tualeh kaiging tumte kaiging tumging bang zong ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amauten mangtoupha mai leh silhing lite leh upate mai ah la tha hileh kilawm khat asa ua, tua la tha pen, leitunga pat a tatsa tua tulza leh tulsawmli leh tullite chilou koiman athei thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte pen numei a kibuasahlou a kikem siengthoute ahi uhi. Tamte pen Belamnou apeina lam lam a zuite ahi uhi. Tamte pen mihingte lah a kipat a tatsa, Pasian ading leh Belamnou a dinga ga masapente ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amaute kam ah zuouthu a um sih a, Pasian mangtoupha mai ah genbanglou in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng dang khat, van kimlai a leeng ka mu a, aman leitunga teng nam chin, phungchin, ham chin leh mi chinte kunga gen ding kumtawn khantanhoi anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ngaitah a kikou in,” Pasian giing unlen, akungah thupina pie un, aziehpen Athukhenna hun ahing tungta hi; tualeh Ama lei leh van, tuipi leh tuinahte siempa khu bie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsieng dang khat in azui a, “Achimta, achimta tua Babilon khopi thupi angkawm hatna thangpaina uoin nam zousie adawnsah ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng dang athumna in amauh azui a, aw ngaitahin: “Mi koipou in tua gamsa leh alim abieh a, atalpang ahiei, akhut ahiei a chiemtena anei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian thangpaina uoin, bangma toh hallou alungthahna nou a kisung adawn dinga, tualeh vansawltah siengthoute mitmu leh Belamnou mitmu ah mei leh kaata gawtna thuohsah ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua agawtna uh meikhu khu kumtawn kumtawnin azamtou ding, tua gamsa leh alim bete leh amin chiemtena nei poumaten, sun leh zan in khawldamna amu sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanah Pasian thupieh zuite leh Jesu gingta misiengthoute kukalna akilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n van a kipat aw khat ka za a, ka kungah, “Giel in, tua kipat mishi, Mangpa a shite khu” “Ahampha uhi.” Hagau in, “Ahi, asepgimna ua kipat akhawldam theita ding uhi, anasepte un amauh ahing zui ding ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachia ka et leh, Ngai vawi, meilum ngou leh tua meilum tunga Mihing Tapa bang Mi khat Alutunga sana manglukhu khuh a, akhut a kawite hiem tawi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsieng dangkhat Pasian biehinn a pat in ahing pawt a, “Aw ngaitah a kikouin meilum tunga toupa kungah, na kawite zang inlen, bu at in, nang a dingin bu at hun atungta hi, aziehpen leitung bu akuoita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua meilum tunga toupa’n, leitung ah akawite apaikheta a, leitung bu khu at in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng dangkhat van a um biehinn apat in ahing pawt a, aman zong kawite hiem khat atawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsieng dang khat maitam a kipat in ahing pawt a, aw ngaitaha kikou in kawite hiem tawipa kungah, “Na kawite hiem zang inlen, leitunga grep ga bomte khawmin, aziehpen grep gate amin siengta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsiengin leitungah akawite apaikheta a, leitunga grepte akhawma, tua khu Pasian lungthahna uoin suhna khuh thupitah sungah apailutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh uoin suhna khu khopi pulam ah akichil hi, tualeh uoin suhna akipat sisan sakol kamkaina tan dongin, lou chiing tul khat leh zaguh tandong aluong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n van ah chiemtena thupi leh lamdang tah: Vansawlsieng sagi, gawtna nukhia sagi tawi ka mu a, tuate a Pasian thangpaina abukim taah ziehin gawtna nukhia ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh bang ahiei mei toh kihal himlang tuipi hileh kilawm, tualeh gamsa tung leh, alim tung leh, achiemtena tung leh, amin nambar tunga, guolzawna tangte, Pasian kaiging tawi a himlang tuipi tunga ding ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amauten Pasian suoh Mosi la leh Belamnou la asa ua, Mangpa Pasian bangkimbawlthei, “Na silbawlte a thupiin a lamdang hi! Misiengthoute leengpa aw, Na lampite dihin atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koi in Nang hing giinglou in, Aw Mangpa, Na min apahtawilou ngam diei? Nang bou na hi asiengthou, Namte zousie ahing pei ding ua, Na mai ah ahing be ding uhi, Na vaihawmna dihte suhlat a aum taah ziehin;” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam silte zoua ka et leh, Ngai vawi, van ah theipina biehbuh kichi biehinnpi akihong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua biehinn a kipat in gawtna sagi tawi vansawlsieng sagi puon malngat siengthou leh vam sil in, tualeh a awm uh sana kawnggah a kigah ahing pawtdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n silhing lite lah a khat in, tua vansawlsieng sagite kungah, kumtawn kumtawna hing zing Pasian lungthahna a dim hengkuong sagi apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua biehinn khu Pasian thupina leh silbawltheina a hing kipan meikhu in adimta a, tualeh vansawlsieng sagite gawtna sagi khu atunkim masangsie tua biehinn sungah koima alut theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua biehinn sunga kipat in aw ngaitah khat ka za a, tua aw in vansawlsieng sagite kungah, “Pei unlen, Pasian thangpaina hengkuongte leitungah sungkhie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng khatna apei a, ahengkuong leitungah asungkhie a, gamsa chiemtena neite leh alim bemite tungah himasie nasetah leh kidahhuoi ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng nina in ahengkuong tuipi tungah asungkhie a, tua tuipi pen mishi sisan bang ahing suohta hi, tuachi’n tuipi a um hinna nei zousie ashita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng thumna in a hengkuong luidungte leh tuinahte ah, asungkhie a; tuate sisan ahing suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tuite vansawlsiengin: “Aw Mangpa tambanga vai na hawm ziehin, Nang umzing leh umta leh, ahing um dingpa na dihtat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen amauten misiengthoute leh, guolneite sisan ana suo ua, tualeh Nangman adawn dingun sisan na pie hi, dawn taah mawng ahi ziehun,” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh maitam a kipat in, aw dang khat in ana dawnga, “Ahi, Mangpa Pasian bangkimbawlthei na, vaihawmnate adih in adihtat hi,” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng lina in ahengkuong ni tungah asungkhie a, ama kungah mihingte mei a halgawp theina pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh mite khu mei satah a haigawin aum ua, Tam gawtnate tunga thuneipa Pasian min agensie ua, tualeh Ama kunga thupina pe dingin akisia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng ngana in ahengkuong gamsa toupha tungah asungkhie a, tuachi’n aleenggam khu ahing mielta a, tualeh amauten na asah sengziehin alei uh apet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua natna leh himate ziehin, van Pasian agensie ua, asilbawlte ua kipat akisia tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng guhna in, ahengkuong Euphrates luipi tungah asungkhie a, suolam leengte dinga lampi bawl ahi theina dingin tua lui tuite akang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh u’keng toh kibang hagau bua thum, dragon kam a kipat leh gamsa kama kipan leh, guolnei tahlou kama kipat a hing pawt ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute pen bangkimbawlthei tua Pasian ni thupi a kidouna a pang thei dinga leitung pumpi leengte puikhawm dinga kuonkhie, sil lamdang bawl dawite hagau ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, guta bangin ka hing pei hi. Kigingsa leh puon tengsa a um mi ahampha hi, tuachilou in pen aguohtang in avah dinga azumhuoina amukha ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amaute khu Hebru ham a Armageddon kichi mun ah apuikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng saginain, ahengkuong huikhuo ah, asungkhie a, van a biehinn a kipat leh mangtoupha a kipat in, aw ngaitah ahing pawt a, “Bawlzou ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh awte, tunphiete, leh vanpi gingte ahing um a, zil nasatah ahing linga, tambang zilling nasa leh thupi leitunga mihing aum akipat aumkha nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua khopi thupi khu sethum in akikhena, namte khopite achimta hi. Tualeh alungthahna uoin nou khu akunga pieh dingin Babilon khopi thupi khu Pasian masangah theidoh in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n tui kuolkhum gam zousie ataimangta a, muol leh taangte mu in aum nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh van a kipat gielpi nasatah mihingte tungah akia a, gieltang chinteng talen khat a gih ahi. Tualeh miten giel a gawtna ziehin Pasian agensie uhi, aziehpen tua gawtna khu ahuoise sengseng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n hengkuong sagi tawi vansawlsieng sagite lah a khat a hing pei a, Kei ahing kihoupi a, ka kungah “Hing pei vawi, tui tampite tunga tou kizuanu thupitah tunga vaihawmna kang ensah ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitunga leengten ama toh mawna thanghuoi abawl ua, tualeh a mawna thangtatna uoin leitunga teng mite dawn khamsah in a um uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman kei pen hagau in gamdai ah ahing pomangta hi. Tualeh numei khat Pasian gensietna minte a dim, lutang sagi leh kii sawm nei gamsa sandup tunga tou ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua numei khu puon sandup leh san au in akijem a, sana leh suongmantam leh tuikepsuong a kijem in ahuasanna kidahhuoi leh athanghuoina nieh a dim sana nou khat akhutin atawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh atalpangah min khat: “THUGUH KIPHUOL BABILON THUPI”, “KIZUATE LEH LEITUNG SIL KIDAH HUOITENU”, chi akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua numei pen misiengthoute sisan leh Jesu martarte sisan dawnkhamin ka mu hi. Ama ka mu tahin lamdang leh chizat huoi kasa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua vansawlsiengin ka kungah, “Bang dinga lamdang sa na hiei? Tua numei leh atuonna lutang sagi leh ki sawm nei gamsa thuguh kiphuol kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua gamsa na mu khu aumsa ahia, tu a umlou khu, kokhuh tobei apat ahing pawtdoh tou dinga, manthaina ah apei ding hi. Tualeh leitung siemchil a pat a hinna laibu a amin uh kigiellou, leitunga tengten tua gamsa umsa, umlou leh, hing um ding khu amu chiengun lamdang asa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami theina dingin pilna lungsim nei akisam hi. Tua lutang sagite pen numeinu touna muol sagite ahi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh leeng sagite ahi uhi, ngate apuata ua, khat a uma, adang khatpen ahing kilang nai tadi sih hi, ahing kilatchiengin tomnoukhat sung aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua gamsa umsa, tulai tah a umlou pen khu agietna ahi a, sagite lah a pang ahi a, manthaina ah apei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua kii sawm na mute khu leenggam nei nailou leeng sawmte ahi uhi; hinanleh amaun gamsa toh naikal khat sung leengte banga thuneina anei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaun kithutuoh tahin lungsim munkhat apuo ua, athuneina u’leh ahatna uh gamsa kungah ape ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamten Belamnou akidoupi ding ua, Belamnou in amauh azou ding hi; aziehpen Ama pen mangpate Mangpa leh leengte Lengpa ahi, tualeh Ama toh umkhawmte pen hatte, telte leh ginumte ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Tua kizuanu touna tui tampi na mute khu, mite, mitampite, namte leh hamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua gamsa tunga kisawm na mute leh gamsain kizuanu amuda ding ua, asa ane ding ua, tualeh mei in ahaltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thute suhtangtunga aum masangsie Ama tup leh ngimte abawl theina ding u’leh aleenggam uh gamsa kunga apieh theina ding un lungsim khat pua a kithutuohna lungsim Pasian in akoi zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tua numei na mu khu leitung leengte tunga vaihawm khopi thupitah khu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nua in vansawlsieng dangkhat silbawltheina thupitah nei a van a kipat hing kumsuh ka mu a, athupina in leitung ataanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ama aw ngai theitawpin akikou a: “Achimta Babilon thupi khu achimta! dawite umna leh hagau gilou chinteng kulpi, asuohta, va sienglou leh kidahhuoi, chinteng bawm asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen nam zousiein ahuasanna, lungthahna uoin nou adawnta ua, leitung leengten ama toh ang akawmta ua, amanu noptatna ziehin leitunga, summet bawlte ahausa gawpta uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n van akipat aw dangkhat ka za a, “Ka mite aw, amanu khelna a na pan khahlouna dingun leh amanu toh na thuohkhawm louna dingun, amanu apat hing pawtdohun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amanu khelnate van atungta a, Pasian in akhelnate athei zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amanu hing pieh bangbangin pekia unlen, anasep dungzuiin aleni in thuh un, azuchia halna nou ah, aleni in halpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akithupisah dan leh anoptat dan, bangbangin bawlgenthei unlen, lunggimsah un, aziehpen amanu’n alungtangin, leengnu in ka tou a, meithai ka hi sih, ka lunggim ngai sih ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuazhiehin ni khat thuin ama gawtna, shina, lusunna, leh kielna, ahing tung dinga, amanu meiin akatum ding hi. Aziehpen atunga vaihawmpa Pasian ahaat ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama toh angkawm leh anoptatpi leitung leengten amanu kihalna meikhu amu chiengun, akaa ding ua, asuun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amanu thuohgimna mu a chiza sengin gamla tah ah a ding ding ua: “Talawm de! talawm de! Babilon khopi thupi leh silbawltheitah khopi, naikal khat sunga na tunga vaihawmna ahing tun ta lawm!” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh leitunga summetbawlten amanu kaain asuun ding uhi; mi koima’n avanzuate uh alei nawnlou ding ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua avanzuate uh pen, sanate, dangkate, suongmantamte, tuikepsuongte, puonmalngatte, puonsan dupte, puonnemte, puon sandangte, sing gimnamtui chinteng, saiha a kibawl van chi tuom tuomte, sing manpha tuomtuomte, sum-eng te, siate, suongkanga kibawl van chi tuomtuomte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh siingthalte, begawte, sathau namtuite, silgimnamtuite, zu leh sathaute, tangbuongte leh mangbute, gantate leh belamte, sakol leh sakollengte, salte leh mihing hinnate bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh “Na hinna in alunggul mama theigaten nang ahing nuasieta ua, tualeh sil tuituoh leh hoi zousiein nang ahing peimangsanta hi. Tamte na mu kia ngai nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam siltea summetbawl mi, amanu zieha hing hausaten, amanu kibawlsietna chiza sengin gamlatah a dingin kap in amau ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh, “Talawm de! talawm de! tua khopi thupi, puon malngat leh puonsandup leh puon sandang sil a, tualeh sana leh suongmantam leh tuikepsuonga kizem nu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naikaal khat sung bep a tambang hausatna thupi bangmalou ahing suohtah mai,” achi uhi. Tualeh kuongpute leh, kuonga khuolzin mi zousie leh kuong hehte, tualeh tuipi tunga summet bawl zousiete gamlatah ah ading ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh amauten tua khopi katna meikhu amutahun akikoukhe ding ua, “Tambanga khopi thupi a um ngai amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun alutung ua leivui kibuoh khumin kap leh mauin akikou ding ua; “Talawm de! talawm de! khopi thupi aw! Ama hausatna zieha tuipi a, kuong nei zousieten hausatna amuna khopi, naikal khat sungin suhsiet ahita hi, achi ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw nang van amanu sietna tungah nuom in, Misiengthoute leh sawltahte leh guolneite nuom un, Pasian in amanu tungah na phuba uh ahing lahpiehta hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng hattah khat in bu hehna suong lienpi bang suong khat adomtou a, tuipi sungah apailut a, “Khopi thupi Babilon, tambanga gumtah a paikhiet suh ahidinga, akimu kia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na sungah gawsem tumte leh lasiemte, theile tumte leh pengkul tumte a kipat ging kilawm kiza ngai nawnlou ding hi. Khut siem banglam poua khut siemmi mawngmawng na sungah akimu nawn sih ding hi. Na sungah buhehna ging akiza nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na sungah meivah ataang nawnsih dinga, mou leh mouneipa aw zong akiza nawn vawt sih ding hi. Na summetbawl mite, tam leitunga miliente ahi ua, Na bumsiemna a nam zousie sol a aumtahzieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh asungah guolneite leh misiengthoute sisan leh leitunga tha a um zousete sisan muin aumta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nua in van ah mipi tampi aw ngaitah ka za a, “Halleluijah, Hundamna leh thupina leh silbawltheina leh zatatna i Mangpa Pasian a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen avaihawmnate athudiha adihtat hi. Aman kizuanu thupi angkawmna a leitung susenu khu vai ahawm khumta a, asuohte sisan phuba amanu tungah alahpiehta hi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun, “Halleluijah tua khopi kihalna meikhu kumtawn kumtawnin azamtou hi,” achi kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n upa sawmni leh lite leh silhing lite khupboh in apua ua, “Amen Halleluijah” chiin mangtoupha tunga toupa Pasian abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n mangtoupha a kipat in aw khat ahing pawt a, “Nou Ama suohte zousie leh Ama giingte zousie alien aneu in i Pasian phat un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mipi tampi aw ging bang leh tui tampi luong ging bang leh, vanpi ging nasatah bang ka zata a: “Halleluijah, Mangpa Pasian bangkimbawlthei in vai ahawm zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite kipah in nuom vai, pahtawina Ama pe vai aziehpen Belamnou zinei hun ahing tungta hi, azi zong akisa zoudiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amounu khu puon malngat siengthou leh vam a akizep ding phal ahi a, tua puon malngat khu misiengthoute dihtatna ahi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Giel in, Belamnou zineina annkuong im dinga chielte ahampha uhi” achi hi. Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Tamte Pasian thudihtahte ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ama be ding in akengbul ah ka puata hi. Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Tuabang bawl sin, Kei Jesu theipina kem na suoh hipipa leh na unaute laha khat ka hi bou hi Pasian bie in, aziehpen Jesu theipina khu thugentheina hagau ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n van kihong ka muta a, Ngai vawi, sakol kaang khat leh atunga tuongpa amin Ginum leh Thutah kichi ka mu a, Aman dihtatnain vai ahawm a, tualeh gal abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amitte khu meikuong bang ahi a, alutungah manglukhu tampi a um hi. Ama loungal koima theilou min kigiel khat anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman sisan a kidiesa puontuol asila ama min khu Pasian Thu akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh van a um galkap hon in puon malngat ngou leh siengthou silin sakol kaang tunga tuong in Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akama kipat in namsau hiemtah namte satna ding in ahing pawtdoh hi. Tualeh Ama mamain amauh tungah siachiengin vai a hawm ding hi. Ama mama in Bangkimbawlthei Pasian giinhuoina leh thangpaina uoin suhna khu atuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Aman apuontuol tung leh a pheipi tungah “LENGTE LENGPA, MANGPATE MANGPA” chia kigiel min anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng khat Ni tunga ding ka mu a, tualeh ama aw ngaitah a kikou in, vanlaizawl a leeng vate kungah “Hing pei unlen, Pasian annkuongluina thupitah ah hing kikhawm un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengte sa, galkap lamkaite sa, mi hatte sa, sakolte sa leh atung ua tuongte sa, tualeh mi zousie, zalen leh saltang, alien leh aneu sa na neh theina dingun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua gamsa leh leitung leengte leh agalkap honte khu, tua sakol tunga tuongpa leh agalkap honte dou dinga hing kikhawm ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamsa khu mat in aumta a, tualeh guolnei tahlou gamsa chiemtena neite leh, alim bete asolna a, amasanga chiemtena lamdang bawlpa zong ama toh mat khawm in a umta a, tamte gel pen ani un, kaat meidil ah ahinga pailut in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh adang teng pen, tua sakol tunga tuongpa kam a kipata hing pawt namsau a thain a umta uhi. Tualeh tungleeng vate zousie amaute sain agilvata uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng khat van a kipata hing kumsuh, akhut a kokhuh tobei chabi leh khainieng lienpi tawi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman tua dragon thupi, nidanglai gulpi aman a, kum tul khat sunga dingin ahenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum tul khat achin masangsie a, namte asol kia nawnlouna dingin kokhuh tobei ah a pailut a, akha khum a, asindetta hi. Tam silte nua chiengin ama pen hun tomkhat sung hakhiet ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mangtouphate leh atunga toute ka mua, akung uah vaihawmna pieh ahi a, tualeh Jesu thu theipina zieh leh, Pasian thu zieha alutang uh tan a um, gamsa leh alim bengailou, atalpang u’leh akhut ua zong chiemtena nei ngailoute hagau te ka mu a, amaute ahing hing ta ua Khrist toh kum sang khat vai ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh mishi dangte pen kum tul khat abei masangsie ahing kia sih uhi. Tam pen thawkiana masa pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawkiana masapen a pang mite ahampha leh asiengthou ahi uhi. Tuabang mite tungah shi ninain thuneina anei sih a, hinanleh amaute pen Pasian leh Khrist siempute ahi ding ua, Ama toh kum tul khat vai ahawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua kum tul khat abei chiengin Setan khu ataanna apat hakhietin a um dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh akuonkhe ding ua, leitung ning li a kipat namte Gog leh Magog asol ding ua kidouna a pang dingin apuikhawm ding uhi. Amaute tamdan tuipi pieu a pieunel bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute leitung vailam daapsuohin akuontou ua, misiengthoute giehphuol leh khopi deiumtah khu a imta uhi. Tuachi’n Pasian akipan in, van a kipat in meikuong ahing kesuh a amaute akatumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh amauh solpa dawimangpa khu, tua gamsa leh guolnei tahlou kipailutna kaat leh meidil sunga pailut ahita uhi. Amaute tuanah kumtawn kumtawn in sun leh zan a thuoh in a umden ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangtoupha vam velvol thupitah khat leh atunga toupa, amai akipata lei leh van taimang ka mu hi. Ama ua dingin mun aum nawn mawngmawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh mishite alien aneu, Pasian mai a ding ka mu a, tualeh laibute phensain aum a, tualeh laibu dangkhat zong phensain aum hi, tua pen hinna laibu ahi, tualeh mishite khu laibu a kigiel bangin, a nasep dungzui ua, thukhenpieh in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi in asunga mishi umte ahing pawtdoh sahta a, tualeh shina leh mishikhuo in zong asunga um mishite ahing pedohta uhi. Michin tungah amauh nasep dungzui a thukhenpieh ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shina leh mishikhuo nangawn meidil sung a pailut in a umta uhi. Tua khu shi nina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh koipou hinna laibu sunga min kigiel khalou pouma meidil sunga pailut in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n leitha leh van tha ka muta a, van masa leh Lei masa pen abeita a, tuipi mawngmawng a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei Johan in khopi siengthou Jerusalem tha, mou apasal a dinga kilawmtah a kizem banga bawlzousa Pasian a kipat leh van a kipat a hing kum suh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh van a kipan aw ngaitah khat in, “Ngai vawi, Pasian biehbuh khu mihingte lah ah a umta hi, Ama alah uah ateng dinga, amauh khu amite ahi ding ua, Pasian mama in amau aumpi dinga, a Pasian uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in amit ua pat hitui zousie asia sieng pieh ding hi; tualeh shina a um nawn sih dinga, lunggimna leh kaana leh natna zong a um nawn sih ding hi; aziehpen sil masate, zousie abeita hi,” achi ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangtoupha tunga toupa’n, “Ngai vawi, sil zousie ka siem thata hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Aman ka kungah, “Giel in aziehpen tam thute adihin aginum ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Bawlzou ahita! Kei Alpha leh Omega, a Bul leh a tawp ka hi. Ken dangtah poumate kungah hinna tuikhuh a tui amanbei in ka peding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aguolzoupa’n tam silte zousie aluo dinga, tualeh a Pasian ka hi dinga, ama zong ka ta ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh meipuote, gingtaloute, kidahhuoite, tuolthatte, numei leh pasal kaal a thangtatte, dawithusiemte, milimbete leh zuouhatte zousie tan ding khu mei leh kaat meidil ahia, tua khu shi nina ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng sagi hengkuong sagitawite, gawtna sagi tawite lah a khat ka kungah ahing pei a, kei ahing houpi a, Tam lang ah “Hingpei in, Mou Belamnou zi ka hing ensah ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Hagau in muol sang lientah tungah ahing zawpita a, tua khopi thupitah, Jerusalem siengthou, Pasian a kipat leh van a kipata hing kumsuh khu ahing ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khopi in Pasian thupina aneia, avah khu suong mantam pen Jasper suong bang ahi a, Kristal suong banga val ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh kulbaang thupitaah leh sangtah anei a, kotpi sawm leh ni anei a, tua kotpite ah vansawlsieng sawm leh ni a um uhi. Tua kotpite tungah Israel nam sawm leh nite min akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suolam ah kotpi thum, mallam ah kotpi thum, simlam ah kotpi thum, leh tumlam ah kotpi thum a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khopi kulbaangin suongphum sawm leh ni aneia, tuate tungah Belamnou sawltah sawm leh nite min atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua kei hing houpi vansawlsieng in, tua khopi leh akotpite leh akulbaang tena ding in tena sana chieng atawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khopi ning li kibang chieta lam ahia adung leh avai akikim a, tualeh aman tua khopi ate a mel tul khat leh zanga ahi. Adunglam leh availam leh asandan akibang chiet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman kulbaang ate a, tong za leh sawmli leh li a hi. Tua pen vansawlsieng in mihing tena dan a ate ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua khopi kulbaang khu Jasper suonga kibawl ahi a, akhopi pen sana sienga kilam, himlang banga sieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua khopi kulbaang suongphumte pen suongmantam namkima kizem ahia, suongphum khatna khu Jasper suong ahia, anina khu Saphire suong ahia, athumna khu kalsidon suong ahia, ali na khu Emerald suong ahia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Angana khu Sardonik suong ahia, aguhna khu Sardia suong ahia, asagina khu Krisolit suong ahia, agietna khu beril suong ahia, akuona khu topaz suong ahia, asawmna khu Krisopras suong ahia, asawm leh khatna khu Jasin suong ahia, asawm leh nina khu Amethist suong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh akotpi sawm leh nite pen tuikepsuong ahia, akotpi chinteng tuikepsuong khat chiet a bawl ahi; tualeh khopi kholai gawlzing khu sana a kibawl, himlang etpailet thei bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua khopi sungah biehinn ka mu sih hi, aziehpen Mangpa Pasian bangkimbawlthei leh Belamnou khu biehinn ahi mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua khopi in ataanvah dingin ni angai sih a, ha zong angai sih hi, aziehpen Pasian thupinain asalvah a, Belamnou khu ameivah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hundam aum namte khu tua vah ah atuolleng ding ua, tualeh leitung leengten athupina u’leh azatat huoina uh apolut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Akotte khu sun in akikha ngai sih ding hi, aziehpen tua mun ah zan a um ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh amaun tua sungah namte thupina leh zatat huoina ahing polut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh tua khopi sungah bangchihlaipouin sil sienglou leh kidahhuoi bawl leh zuou bawl mawngmawng alut sih ding hi; hinanleh Belamnou hinna laibu a min kigielte bou alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua vansawlsiengin hinna tui sieng luonna lui ahing ensah a, tua lui pen kristal banga sieng, Pasian leh Belamnou Mangtoupha apat a hing luong khie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khopi gawlzing laikimtah leh luipang tuoh ah ga chi sawmleni nei, hachin a ga, hinna singkung apou hi, tualeh tua sing nate khu namte suhdamna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuanah hamsie mawngmawng a um nawn sih dinga, hinanleh Pasian leh Belamnou Mangtoupha aum zawta ding hi, tualeh asuohten Ana aseppieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten A mel amu ding ua, a talpang uah A min atuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuanah zan aum nawn sih dinga, mei vah leh ni vah zong apoimaw nawn sih ding uhi, aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in amauh ataanvah dinga, tualeh amauten kumtawn kumtawn in vai ahawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Tam thute aginum in adih ahi, tualeh guolnei siengthoute Mangpa Pasian in sil hing tung pai dingte asuohte musah dingin a vansawlsieng asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai un, hing pei pai ding ka hi, tam laibu a genlawhna thute zui poumate ahampha hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei Johan in tam silte ka mu a ka zah ahi. Tualeh ka zah a ka mutahin, tam silte hing musah vansawlsieng be dingin akengbul ah ka puasuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, ngaiin, “Tambangin bawl vawt sin, Keipen nang leh na unau guolneite leh tam laibu sunga thukigente zuite suoh hipipa ka hi bou hi; Pasian bie in,” ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh aman ka kungah, “Tam laibu a genlawhna thute khakhum sin, aziehpen ahun tung ding ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi dihlou khu dihlouin um nalai henlen, mi nieh khu aniehin um nalai heh, tualeh midihtat khu dihtatin um nalai henlen, misiengthou khu siengthouin um nalai heh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngai in, hing pei pai ding ka hi, tualeh michin anasep dungzui a pieh ding ka nuomman ka kungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Alpha leh Omega, Amasapen leh a Nukhiapen a Bul leh Atawp ka hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna singkunga tan anei theina ding u’leh, tua khopi kotpite a alut theina ding ua, apuonsilte uh sawpsiengte khu ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh pulam ah, uite leh dawithusiemte, numei leh pasal kaal a thangtatte, tuolthatte leh milimbete, tualeh koipou zuou ngaina a zuoubawlte a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei Jesu’n hattuomte dinga tam theipina thute na kunga hing theisah dingin ka vansawlsieng ka hing sawl ahi. Kei David zungpi leh ahah asuon leh zingsol aasi tangpha ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Hagau leh Mou in, “Hing pei in,” achi uhi. Aza tapouin “Hing pei in” chi hen. Tualeh koizong adangta a pouma hing pei heh. Koi zong a ut pouma in hinna tui amanbeiin dawn heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koipou tam laibu sunga genlawhna za taphot kungah ka theisah ahi, mi koipou in tam thute abelap leh Pasian in tam laibu a kigiel gawtnate, atungah abelap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh koipou in tam genlawhna thute tam laibu apat alahmang leh hinna singkung leh khopi siengthou leh, tam laibu a kigiel silte apata atan ding khu, Pasian in alahmang pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam silte theisahpa’n, “Pellou in, ka hing pei pai ding” achi hi. Amen. Hing pei in, Mangpa Jesu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina na unpi ua kungah umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
